1
00:00:00,643 --> 00:00:02,593
(Amy:)intelligent dog uprising.

2
00:00:04,246 --> 00:00:07,416
(Amy:)FYI, we plan on selling out
the human race hard.

3
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,520
(Penny:)In 20 years, who knows
what'll happen with any of us?

4
00:00:13,689 --> 00:00:16,169
(Stuart:)I think you and Leonard
will be together.

5
00:00:16,325 --> 00:00:17,775
(Penny:)-You do?
-Yeah.

6
00:00:17,927 --> 00:00:19,707
(Stuart:)I think you're
the best couple I know.

7
00:00:19,862 --> 00:00:21,032
(Penny:)That's so sweet.

8
00:00:21,197 --> 00:00:22,577
(Bernadette:)-What the hell?
-Excuse me?

9
00:00:24,266 --> 00:00:26,436
Duh, duh, duh...
Let the dead man talk.

10
00:00:27,837 --> 00:00:29,107
(Penny:)So, why do you think that?

11
00:00:29,271 --> 00:00:33,881
(Stuart:)Well, I feel like you guys
make each other better.

12
00:00:34,043 --> 00:00:36,253
(Stuart:)Penny brought Leonard
out of his shell.

13
00:00:36,412 --> 00:00:39,052
(Stuart:)And it seems like Leonard makes Penny
think more deeply about the world.

14
00:00:39,215 --> 00:00:43,595
(Stuart:)I don't know. Together, you two
kind of make one awesome person.

15
00:00:44,687 --> 00:00:46,287
(Penny:)Aw, Stuart.

16
00:00:46,455 --> 00:00:48,055
(Penny:)Now I feel bad for murdering you.

17
00:00:48,224 --> 00:00:50,224
Oh, come on!

18
00:00:51,293 --> 00:01:02,023
Penny did it! I win!
Suck it, jackasses!

